{"text": "For Beatrice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Friday began. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Like any other day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She wore the same white socks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On both of her feet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then she made a sandwich. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She put exactly the same amount of peanut butter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On each piece of bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On her way to school. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her neighbor said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Good morning, Perfect Girl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> People called Beatrice Perfect Girl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because she never made mistakes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Are you ready for tonights talent show. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her neighbor asked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Beatrice just smiled. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was a juggling champion. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She won the talent show. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every year. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How wonderful she was.", "alignment": {"characters": ["F", "o", "r", " ", "B", "e", "a", "t", "r", "i", "c", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "r", "i", "d", "a", "y", " ", "b", "e", "g", "a", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "L", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", "n", "y", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "d", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "m", "e", " ", "w", "h", "i", "t", "e", " ", "s", "o", "c", "k", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "n", " ", "b", "o", "t", "h", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "f", "e", "e", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", 